  date-released: 2026-09-29
  keywords:
* machine learning
* dataset shift
* distribution shift
* data drift
* model monitoring
* risk estimation
* machine learning reliability
  abstract: >-
  PreShift is a Python library for prediction-aware dataset shift detection
  and risk estimation. It combines multiple distributional shift signals with
  a risk prediction layer to estimate potential downstream model degradation
  from unlabeled incoming data. The library provides statistical shift
  detection, risk prediction, decision gating, calibration, and an
  end-to-end monitoring pipeline.

